        "original_id": "3b4b97e7-28ec-51b3-9b55-6b5229c09931",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Deron Miller, Chad I Ginsburg, Jess Margera, Matt Deis\n- Bands: CKY, Violent Femmes\n- Places: Milwaukee, Wisconsin\n- Roles: lead vocalist, guitarist, backing vocalist, drummer, bassist\n\nFacts:\n- Violent Femmes is an American folk punk band from Milwaukee, Wisconsin, and the band was initially active from 1980 to 2009.\n- CKY was formed in 1998 by Deron Miller, Chad I Ginsburg, and Jess Margera.\n- Deron Miller was CKY's lead vocalist and guitarist at its formation.\n- Chad I Ginsburg was CKY's guitarist and backing vocalist at its formation, and he is part of the band's current lineup.\n- Jess Margera was CKY's drummer at its formation, and he is part of the band's current lineup.\n- Matt Deis is CKY's current bassist.",
